314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 240 0 R
/T (The rapid growth of digital assets such as cryptocurrency, online banking credentials, cloud documents, social media accounts, digital contracts, and intellectual property has created major challenges in secure asset management and inheritance. Existing inheritance and estate planning systems are mostly manual, centralized, and unable to efficiently handle digital assets distributed across multiple online platforms. These systems often lack transparency, automation, strong authentication, and secure verification mechanisms.)
/E (The rapid growth of digital assets such as cryptocurrency, online banking credentials, cloud documents, social media accounts, digital contracts, and intellectual property has created major challenges in secure asset management and inheritance. Existing inheritance and estate planning systems are mostly manual, centralized, and unable to efficiently handle digital assets distributed across multiple online platforms. These systems often lack transparency, automation, strong authentication, and secure verification mechanisms.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 240 0 R
/T (Current solutions also fail to provide reliable real-time monitoring and AI-driven fraud detection, increasing the risk of identity theft, unauthorized access, false inheritance claims, and data tampering. Traditional methods cannot accurately verify critical events such as death or incapacitation, resulting in legal disputes, delays, and security vulnerabilities during asset transfer processes.)
/E (Current solutions also fail to provide reliable real-time monitoring and AI-driven fraud detection, increasing the risk of identity theft, unauthorized access, false inheritance claims, and data tampering. Traditional methods cannot accurately verify critical events such as death or incapacitation, resulting in legal disputes, delays, and security vulnerabilities during asset transfer processes.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 240 0 R
/T (To address these issues, there is a need for a secure, transparent, and automated digital inheritance framework that leverages blockchain technology, smart contracts, encryption, multi-factor authentication, biometrics, and AI-based anomaly detection. The proposed system aims to ensure tamper-proof asset storage, automated inheritance execution, secure nominee verification, and legally compliant digital asset transfer while maintaining privacy, trust, and scalability.)
/E (To address these issues, there is a need for a secure, transparent, and automated digital inheritance framework that leverages blockchain technology, smart contracts, encryption, multi-factor authentication, biometrics, and AI-based anomaly detection. The proposed system aims to ensure tamper-proof asset storage, automated inheritance execution, secure nominee verification, and legally compliant digital asset transfer while maintaining privacy, trust, and scalability.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
