1633 0 obj
<<
/Title (The rapid growth of digital assets such as cryptocurrency, online banking credentials, cloud documents, social media accounts, digital contracts, and intellectual property has created major challenges in secure asset management and inheritance. Existing inheritance and estate planning systems are mostly manual, centralized, and unable to efficiently handle digital assets distributed across multiple online platforms. These systems often lack transparency, automation, strong authentication, and secure verification mechanisms.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1548 0 R
/Next 1638 0 R
>>
endobj
1634 0 obj
<<
/Title (To address these issues, there is a need for a secure, transparent, and automated digital inheritance framework that leverages blockchain technology, smart contracts, encryption, multi-factor authentication, biometrics, and AI-based anomaly detection. The proposed system aims to ensure tamper-proof asset storage, automated inheritance execution, secure nominee verification, and legally compliant digital asset transfer while maintaining privacy, trust, and scalability.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1548 0 R
/Prev 1638 0 R
>>
endobj
